    <!-- Trial terms disclosure (Play Subscriptions policy — trial terms must clearly state
         the trial length, the post-trial price + cadence, and how to cancel; on the offer AND
         near the CTA). These are the OFFLINE / back-compat FALLBACKS only — the dashboard
         (PaywallDto.trial* fields) overrides them so the copy is fully tenant-configurable.
         Placeholder tokens are substituted by the SDK: {days} = trial length,
         {price} = pre-formatted "price / interval" e.g. "₹299 / month". Same token shape as
         the dashboard templates so one substitution path serves both. -->
    <string name="paycraft_trial_plan_terms">{days}-day free trial, then {price}</string>
    <string name="paycraft_trial_disclosure_title">{days}-day free trial included</string>
    <string name="paycraft_trial_disclosure_body">Your free trial converts to a paid subscription automatically when it ends. Cancel anytime before then in your store subscription settings to avoid being charged.</string>

    <!-- ═══ Phase 3b — paywall states (AC-25..AC-28) ═══ -->

    <!-- Device conflict (AC-25). The payload carries the conflicting device name and a support
         address; the old two-line body discarded both, which is why this state was a dead end —
         the user was told to "sign in there" with no way to do it from here. (It also carried an
         OTP send budget until the emailed-code gate was removed on 2026-09-06.) -->
